<h1>About</h1>
<p>This is the final capstone requirement for my WPH Bootcamp (July - August, 2025).</p>
<p>
    Our To-Do List Application is a task management system designed to help users organize and track their daily activities efficiently. The system supports full CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) functionality, allowing users to add new tasks, view their existing tasks, update details, and remove completed or unnecessary tasks.
    <br />
    <br />To enhance usability, the app includes filtering and sorting features where users can filter tasks based on priority levels, sort tasks by due date (ascending or descending), or search for specific tasks through a search box.
    <br />
    <br />The interface also includes a sidebar navigation, which categorizes tasks into different sections: All Tasks, Completed Tasks, and Deleted Tasks, making it easier for users to manage their workflow and keep track of their progress.
    <br />
    <br />This project demonstrates practical task management features in a simple yet functional application that emphasizes usability and productivity.
</p></>